{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_13_level_main_13-10_beg","groupId":"main_13","stageId":"main_13-10","title":"破碎温室","storyCode":"13-12","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-10_beg.txt","sourceHash":"b821d9853a12db0dd2e573c4b51d1fca9cfbb74ba6d5a09a8d55aa4467f87cc4","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我是幸运的人。\n在祖父沐浴于温室的阳光中，捧着他最爱的花溘然离世前，他已经为我打点好了一切。\n我的余生会如我们共同期望的那样，在镇子里这间小小的温室安稳度过。\n直到他们的到来。\n我曾无比恐慌，恐慌自己的生活将被打破......\n但那个萨卡兹下了命令，我的工作依然是留在这里，留在温室。\n我依然是小镇的园丁。\n距离那两个“自救军”成员的到访，已经过了一周的时间。\n那位会为雏菊翻土的萨卡兹尉官，也一周没有出现在镇子里过了。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g6_townbuildingsite"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下午好，玛格达尔。你捧着花的样子还是那么漂亮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，汉克。你见到威尔了吗？我在找他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他一早订了花，可是都下午了还没有来取。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威尔订的花？哦，是为了芙蕾达的生日吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中午他就翘班溜走了，兴许是为芙蕾达准备惊喜去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别担心，等他被芙蕾达教训的时候，他会记起来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们看上去很憔悴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最近晚上都听到工地这边有声响，你们一直没有休息？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近那些魔族佬像是要给谁展示功绩，死了命地催大伙日夜赶工，可也没看到有啥大人物来呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你运气真好，被人分配了个好差事，不用遭这些罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到大伙咬咬牙，居然只用了不到一个月就建成了这些奇迹！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我打赌，这东西要是放以前，准会被那些伦蒂尼姆的贵族老爷们全搬进博物馆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汉克，你明明之前很讨厌这份工作......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......玛格达尔，世道变了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（你也得学着讨好那个萨卡兹军官，这对你没有坏处，孩子。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢你的建议，汉克，我会考虑的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"汉克的建议总是如此真诚。\n但他的想法却让我无比恐惧。\n夜里失眠的时候，广场上的声音像一柄铁锤在我的脑中砸得嗡嗡作响。\n偶尔的浅梦中，那些诡异的石头又将我惊醒。\n我总是不禁想起一周前那两位自救军的担忧。\n也许萨卡兹改变的，不仅仅是我们的生活方式。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烦躁的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烦躁的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近这些炮声怎么越来越近了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烦躁的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说不止一伙人想要占领我们布伦特伍德镇，可万一真打起来又是乌烟瘴气，唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烦躁的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在这样大家都和和气气不好吗？只求别影响了我们的工期！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚少年","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"玛格达尔姐姐，可算找到你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚少年","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"那个经常去你家的魔族佬在带人砸你的温室！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g7_towngreenhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够了吗？我说过这里不可能藏着那些维多利亚人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"现在可不是你说了算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"这间毫无用处的屋子是你当初力保才留下的，谁知道你藏了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，我们都该为殿下死战到底，你的软弱让我们一次又一次丧失好机会！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"注意你的口气，雇佣兵，我现在还是王庭军的成员，这里的指挥官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，要是我在这里找到藏着的游击队，我马上宰了你领功，也申请加入王庭军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"收好那些让我反胃的厌战情绪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"那些人的行动已经严重干扰了军事委员会在这里的安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是你在前线的失利让那些人越来越猖狂，头儿也不至于决定仓促完成任务提前交差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，闭上你的嘴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的温室......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘘——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不要动，安静看着。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，唔——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑土埋葬了它们。\n雏菊，玫瑰，蓝铃花......\n它们的根茎被无情地踩在脚下碾碎。\n还有那些向阳勃发的新芽。\n芙蕾达对这些为农事节撒下的种子抱有期待。\n她说，那会是一个十年来最盛大的农事节庆典。\n我们都期待着。\n但现在，新芽不再存在了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放松，你的手指在流血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要试图挣脱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我在救你的命，“园丁”。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"放她过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"她最好真的想对我动手，那样我砍了她就完事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你对这座镇子太客气了，“指挥官”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"靠瞪眼睛可杀不死我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，扫兴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"花草对这场战争毫无意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"兵工厂，炸药房，焚烧炉，它们才是你们真正需要的东西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"温室里最后的一株新芽被掐碎了。\n祖父，明年的农事节上再也不会有鲜花了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放开我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很冷静。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们找到想要的东西了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你运气很好，没有让我们搜出来什么东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那请你们离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为你会比工地那些蠢货更有胆子一点呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，维多利亚人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别动，你的手指需要包扎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拦不下他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在前线......发生了些事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"马上会有另一个人来接替我的职位，他对小镇，呃，另有安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布伦特伍德入口西边两百米左右的水泥工事有一处缺口，是那些附近游荡的游击队刚炸出来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们不会放弃这个机会，所以我们要在明天早上五点修复那个缺口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"奇怪的萨卡兹。\n为什么要告诉我这些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些玫瑰还有救，想办法重新栽好这些可怜的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你对那个缺口好奇，今晚带上这些玫瑰穿过我们的营地，这是最安全的路径。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是有人拦你，就说你在替我送订单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，如果能顺道放一束花在我的营帐，我会很开心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些东西不该被摧毁，“园丁”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“园丁”不是我的名字，萨卡兹，我的名字是玛格达尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，那就重新认识一下，我的名字是“锹子”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“锹子”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军尉官","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记住，玛格达尔，时间不等人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"“我们为农事节种下的，是象征希望之物。”\n祖父是这么教我的，每年庆典上沿街的鲜花寄托了大家对于大丰收的质朴祝愿。\n没有什么地方能比现在的布伦特伍德镇更需要希望。\n我不能离开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini02_victoria_street_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的营帐应该是这个方向......得赶紧把花送过去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么在这？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛格达尔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......宵禁时间你拿着花要去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这边是军营方向，快离开！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......没事，只是想出来走走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，听汉克说今天是你的生日，生日快乐！威尔在我这为你订了花，但一直没有来取。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你见到威尔，记得提醒他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蕾达？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么不说话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我来，这边不安全。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......这些花？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是威尔放这悼念我父亲的。这间仓库我一直锁着，只有威尔想偷偷喝酒的时候我才会把钥匙借他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这门礼炮，这是韦斯特先生为农事节特意准备的？真是壮观......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我对不起威尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威尔出什么事了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚在萨卡兹的军营里，威尔被那些魔族佬留下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他今天提前找到我想准备惊喜。但知道我要进军营汇报施工进度后，他不放心，就自告奋勇护送我去军营......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可那些萨卡兹没有道理留下威尔......他们从来没这么干过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道......我很害怕，我不敢拒绝他们扣下威尔的要求......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明我什么都听他们的了。我完成了他们交代的所有要求，为什么还要留下威尔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么......玛格达尔，我真的做错了吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蕾达，也许，也许他们只是留下威尔想问些什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"往好的地方想想，他们还需要威尔继续为他们卖力呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的......那些鬼东西还差一点才建完，他们一定也需要威尔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要守在军营门口，等着威尔出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"芙蕾达笑了出来。\n但我没有一丝开心的感觉。\n我知道我在欺骗她，她一定也知道，但这是我们现在唯一能做的事了。\n这些日子里谁都需要那一丝丝的侥幸来麻醉自己。\n“希望”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛格达尔","speakerId":"avg_494_vendla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蕾达......你看到了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"房梁上攀附着一只奇怪的生物。\n我不知道它是否还能被称为“生物”。\n它用黑色的腔体凝视我。\n这可怖东西虚弱的肢体再也无法附着在房梁上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"最终它坠落在用于祭奠的鲜花中，消散，化作一滴血，染红了花蕊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蕾达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1069_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它刚才......在看着我们？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"是的，它在看着我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
